{"type": "action", "tool": "summarize_codebase", "args": {"directory": "/Users/shivamjaiswal/Desktop/IntelliVox"}, "result": {"success": true, "summary": "Here are the project details summarized as bullet points:\n\n**Project Purpose:**\n\n* Build a cross-platform voice agent desktop app for macOS, Windows, and Linux\n* UI is built with React + Electron, connects to backend over WebSocket\n* Whisper, speech-to-text, and task execution run in a separate backend (e.g. `voice/` folder)\n\n**Folder Structure:**\n\n* `intellivox-ui/`: UI codebase for desktop app\n\t+ `electron/`: Desktop shell (main + preload)\n\t+ `src/`: React UI\n\t+ `public/`: Static assets\n\t+ `dist/`: Web build (used by packaged app)\n\t+ `release/`: Installers (after building)\n* `voice/`: Backend codebase for whisper, speech-to-text, and task execution\n\n**Main Modules:**\n\n* `electron/main.cjs`: Main process for Electron desktop shell\n* `src/main.jsx`: Entry point for React UI\n* `voice/test_whisper.py`: Example script for live microphone transcription using Systran/faster-whisper-medium model\n\n**Tech Stack:**\n\n* Frontend: React, Electron\n* Backend: WebSocket, Python (using faster-whisper-medium model)\n* Operating Systems: macOS, Windows, Linux", "files_read": 6, "directory": "/Users/shivamjaiswal/Desktop/IntelliVox"}, "verified": true, "ts": "2026-07-24T14:01:54.104916+00:00"}
